      <h1 id="important-changes-to-openshift-jenkins-images" class="group scroll-mt-20">Important changes to OpenShift Jenkins images<a href="#important-changes-to-openshift-jenkins-images" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
